                        "username": "gtmills"
                    },
                    "message": "liquidflow was only added 4 months ago.\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/blame/d120d2ec96b4312436644129791f9d586e1ae171/yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/Sensor/Value.interface.yaml#L11 \npressure has been around a while so not sure why it wasn't here before. \n\nA link to PDI defining this would be helpful"
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 9,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Ed Tanous",
                        "email": "ed@tanous.net",
                        "username": "edtanous"
                    },
                    "message": "Yep, lets get this rephrased to be accurate then this seems fine.\n\n\nPressure was added a few years ago, and I don't see any systems that actually enabled pressure sensors, so I guess it never got added.\n\nhttps://github.com/openbmc/phosphor-dbus-interfaces/commit/69d821b0368b8c6943a91c7f96528e2c0047f432"
                },
                {
